{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A microphone is required to play MIMESIS.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For a more immersive experience, we recommend using a <u>headset or earphones</u> instead of speakers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you see this message? You\u2019ve reached the tram. Welcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Mimesis</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimesis will imitate you and your allies perfectly. Behavior, voice, anything humans can do.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always doubt the person in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.poster.avif?t=1766974424\" width=1084 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.webm?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.mp4?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Gather four</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need allies.\u00a0Three is too few. Five is too many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.poster.avif?t=1766974424\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.webm?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.mp4?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Survive</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The danger isn\u2019t only Mimesis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed rain may fall, or monsters may appear.\u00a0<strong>Stay alive</strong>, together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.poster.avif?t=1766974424\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.webm?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.mp4?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Repair the tram</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s old. It could break anytime.\u00a0Collect scraps. Fix it when you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/5fa6ba9f63696648cdef89b5e1b6d0f1.poster.avif?t=1766974424\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/5fa6ba9f63696648cdef89b5e1b6d0f1.webm?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/5fa6ba9f63696648cdef89b5e1b6d0f1.mp4?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>An enemy that mimics you</i></strong> \u2013 Mimesis copies your voice, behavior, even your memories.\u00a0Can you tell what\u2019s real and what\u2019s not?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Up to 4 player coop survival</i></strong> \u2013 Repair the tram and survive together. But no one knows if trust will last until the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unpredictable horror</i></strong> \u2013 Every run brings new threats and changing environments. Collect scraps and escape before it\u2019s too late.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Our Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us on Steam and join our official Discord. Find allies to play, survive, and talk with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2827200?t=1766974424","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/7a88a3a21b52e00daf3e11d895b6a0e3f0a71890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766974424","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/93d9d7a43e68c4f8e96664cec3bbff4b27ffa48a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766974424","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/93d9d7a43e68c4f8e96664cec3bbff4b27ffa48a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766974424","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A microphone is required to play MIMESIS.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For a more immersive experience, we recommend using a <u>headset or earphones</u> instead of speakers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you see this message? You\u2019ve reached the tram. Welcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Mimesis</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimesis will imitate you and your allies perfectly. Behavior, voice, anything humans can do.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always doubt the person in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.poster.avif?t=1766974424\" width=1084 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.webm?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.mp4?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Gather four</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need allies.\u00a0Three is too few. Five is too many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.poster.avif?t=1766974424\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.webm?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.mp4?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Survive</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The danger isn\u2019t only Mimesis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed rain may fall, or monsters may appear.\u00a0<strong>Stay alive</strong>, together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.poster.avif?t=1766974424\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.webm?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.mp4?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Repair the tram</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s old. It could break anytime.\u00a0Collect scraps. Fix it when you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/5fa6ba9f63696648cdef89b5e1b6d0f1.poster.avif?t=1766974424\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/5fa6ba9f63696648cdef89b5e1b6d0f1.webm?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/5fa6ba9f63696648cdef89b5e1b6d0f1.mp4?t=1766974424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>An enemy that mimics you</i></strong> \u2013 Mimesis copies your voice, behavior, even your memories.\u00a0Can you tell what\u2019s real and what\u2019s not?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Up to 4 player coop survival</i></strong> \u2013 Repair the tram and survive together. But no one knows if trust will last until the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unpredictable horror</i></strong> \u2013 Every run brings new threats and changing environments. Collect scraps and escape before it\u2019s too late.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Our Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us on Steam and join our official Discord. Find allies to play, survive, and talk with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ReLU Games, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/8a2a6edc97fbf23ea6941974bdf4ed9a6ab34eb4/header.jpg?t=1766974424","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 ReLU Games, Inc. All rights reserved. Published and distributed by ReLU Games Publishing.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2827200/1259566332/493b82f8386e1bc8f56aaa3729aa8a22faf4edb5/1761351836/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761363422","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2827200/1259566332/493b82f8386e1bc8f56aaa3729aa8a22